        "seg_cer": 0.211,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "接下来，我们来聊一聊近期中国天文年历显示啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.961,
      "end": 8.452,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "昨天是四点十九分十六秒就迎来了秋分的节气。",
      "score": 0.1519,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0099,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0121,
        "sc_delta": -0.0022,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.15,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "分/风",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "昨天十四点十九分十六秒，就迎来了球风的节气。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.755,
      "end": 11.885,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "那么秋分的时候啊，这个太阳呢就直射赤道，",
      "score": 0.0295,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0119,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0124,
        "sc_delta": -0.0004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.008,
        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那么秋分的时候呀，这个太阳呢，就直射赤道。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 11.885,
      "end": 19.659,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "昼夜就平分了。那么从二零一八年起啊，我们国家呢就把秋分日呢就设为了中国农民的丰收节。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0016,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0019,
        "sc_delta": -0.0003,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "昼夜就平分了。那么从二零一八年起啊，我们国家呢就把秋分日呢就设为了中国农民的丰收节。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 19.914,
      "end": 24.14,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "秋分与天文、气象和农业到底有哪些关系呢？",
