      "start": 27.286,
      "end": 30.565,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "太阳沿着黄道运行一周共三百六十度，",
      "score": 0.4978,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2355,
